    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a haunted house, your only chance of survival is to stay hidden and find the key to escape. Ghosts roam the halls, reacting to every sound and movement. Use your surroundings to stay out of sight, uncover clues, and navigate the eerie darkness. Will you escape, or become another lost soul in the house?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-based horror</strong> \u2013 Stay quiet and out of sight to avoid the ghosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic AI</strong> \u2013 Ghosts react to sound, movement, and your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric environment</strong> \u2013 Explore a chilling and immersive haunted house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-solving</strong> \u2013 Find hidden key to escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart the spirits and find your way out?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a haunted house, your only chance of survival is to stay hidden and find the key to escape. Ghosts roam the halls, reacting to every sound and movement. Use your surroundings to stay out of sight, uncover clues, and navigate the eerie darkness. Will you escape, or become another lost soul in the house?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-based horror</strong> \u2013 Stay quiet and out of sight to avoid the ghosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic AI</strong> \u2013 Ghosts react to sound, movement, and your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric environment</strong> \u2013 Explore a chilling and immersive haunted house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-solving</strong> \u2013 Find hidden key to escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart the spirits and find your way out?</p>",
